### Quick Checklist Before Launch

- [ ] All core pages are responsive (mobile first)
- [ ] Cart persists across sessions (localStorage + Redux)
- [ ] Checkout redirects to payment provider
- [ ] Auth flows work (login, register, forgot password)
- [ ] Admin routes protected (middleware)
- [ ] SEO meta tags & structured data added
- [ ] Accessibility audit passed (axe, Lighthouse)
- [ ] Unit + E2E tests all green
- [ ] CI pipeline builds & deploys automatically
- [ ] Monitoring set up (Sentry, LogRocket)

